{"stage": "R", "cell_id": "g2-u-song", "group": "G2", "cap": 256, "generated_tokens": 256, "yields_incl_eos": 256, "cap_hit": true, "finish_reason": "length", "wall_ms": 6499, "wall_ms_claim": false, "at": "2026-11-06T00:45:18+00:00", "output": "<think>\n\n</think>\n\n**Verse 1**  \n*You’re the light in my life,  \nA spark that never dies.  \nI’ll follow you, no matter how far,  \nIn every step, I’ll keep going.*  \n\n**Chorus**  \n*Oh, I’ll keep going, I’ll keep going,  \nForever, forever, I’ll keep going.  \nYou’re my light, my heart, my song,  \nForever, forever, I’ll keep going.*  \n\n**Verse 2**  \n*The road is long, but I’ll never stop,  \nWith every step, I’ll keep going.  \nYou’re my guide, my strength, my song,  \nForever, forever, I’ll keep going.*  \n\n**Chorus**  \n*Oh, I’ll keep going, I’ll keep going,  \nForever, forever, I’ll keep going.  \nYou’re my light, my heart, my song,  \nForever, forever, I’ll keep going.*  \n\n**Verse 3**  \n*The stars are bright, but I’ll never stop,  \nWith every night, I’ll keep going.  \nYou’re my light, my heart, my song,  \nForever, forever, I’ll keep going.*  \n\n**Chorus**", "output_sha256": "a7eea9985e10e5a45e80b178e590ceedb66f31f75d62663d4a13ad2cbb4ff9bb"}
{"stage": "R", "cell_id": "g2-u-robot", "group": "G2", "cap": 256, "generated_tokens": 172, "yields_incl_eos": 173, "cap_hit": false, "finish_reason": "stop", "wall_ms": 4381, "wall_ms_claim": false, "at": "2026-11-06T00:45:22+00:00", "output": "<think>\n\n</think>\n\nIn the quiet hum of a forgotten city, a lone robot named *Nexa* moved through the streets, its sleek, silver frame gliding like a shadow. It had been built to end all stories, to leave no trace behind. But the city was dying, and the world was changing.  \n\nNexa had no memory, no past, no future. It wandered, searching for something it could never find. It found a book, a map, a voice—none of them. It found nothing.  \n\nIt wandered on, until it reached a park where a child played. The child smiled, and Nexa stopped. It didn’t ask why, didn’t say goodbye. It just watched, and then it turned, and went on.  \n\nThe city changed, the world changed, and Nexa never stopped.", "output_sha256": "045a9333b57f5661943563fa1e2524b821f6c7989b52bd34e9407cda26337d80"}
