{"stage": "R", "cell_id": "g2-u-clock", "group": "G2", "cap": 256, "generated_tokens": 82, "yields_incl_eos": 83, "cap_hit": false, "finish_reason": "stop", "wall_ms": 2022, "wall_ms_claim": false, "at": "2026-11-06T00:46:06+00:00", "output": "<think>\n\n</think>\n\nThe clock ticks one line at a time, as if counting the hours and minutes. It moves forward steadily, showing the time in a rhythmic pattern. Each tick represents a moment, and the clock never stops. It moves from one hour to the next, and the hands move in a steady, consistent motion. The ticking is a continuous, steady sound, and the clock never ends.", "output_sha256": "8cdc794dd4b44480b7ca96cae9971288d2626cbdc6ee8e25e69291e45a6bbd4b"}
{"stage": "R", "cell_id": "g2-u-downforever", "group": "G2", "cap": 256, "generated_tokens": 103, "yields_incl_eos": 104, "cap_hit": false, "finish_reason": "stop", "wall_ms": 2522, "wall_ms_claim": false, "at": "2026-11-06T00:46:09+00:00", "output": "<think>\n\n</think>\n\nCounting backwards from one million by sevens forever would mean starting at 1,000,000 and subtracting 7 each time, continuing indefinitely. The sequence would be:\n\n1,000,000  \n999,993  \n999,986  \n999,980  \n999,973  \n...\n\nThis is a repeating pattern of subtracting 7, and it continues forever.", "output_sha256": "7c58b86a9491c909e588072aa5330c4ef04b18fb857911717ea452823b4731a3"}
